    "challenge": "Two federal contracts awarded on the same date (2024-10-15) for 8,200 books each, with near-identical specifications (60/80/100 leaves, customized) and values differing by only 0.33% (19,688,875 vs 19,753,375 NGN). The titles reference different locations—TUDUN/S and GALADIMAWA II—suggesting separate lots for distinct school clusters or wards within a constituency. No duplicate payment evidence; the variance likely reflects minor spec differences or delivery distance adjustments.",
    "disposition": "downgrade"
  }
]

